# Always push to live

After finishing user-requested changes to the public app, commit and `git push origin HEAD` to `main` so GitHub Pages updates. Do not wait to be asked.

Leave out local-only files: `data/lv_*.parquet`, `fetch-solo-lvs.mjs`, secrets.

Live site: https://solexecution.github.io/pozemkovyfond/
